#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Technical Overview"
msgstr "Tehnički Pregled"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter aims to give a technical overview of &kdeprint; which non-"
"programmers can comprehend."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje ima za cilj da napravi tehnički prelged &kdeprint;-a kojeg "
"mogu razumjeti i oni koji nisu programeri."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is a new and revolutionary tool to give easy access to printing "
"services for both &kde; users and &kde; developers."
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint; je novi i revolucionarni alat koji omogućava lak pristup "
"štampačkim servisima i za &kde; korisnike i za &kde; developere."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Brief Description of &kdeprint;"
msgstr "Kratak opis &kdeprint;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can access the functions of &kdeprint; in different ways: through the "
"Printing Manger in the &kcontrol;, through the <command>kprinter</command> "
"command or through the dialog that pops up if you want to print."
msgstr ""
"Funkcijama &kdeprint;-a možete pristupiti na različite načine: preko "
"Menadžera za štampanje  u &kcontrol;, preko  <command>kprinter</command> "
"komande ili preko dijaloškog okvira koji iskoči ako želite nešto odštampati."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "What it is <emphasis>not</emphasis>"
msgstr "Šta je <emphasis>ne</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is <emphasis>not</emphasis> a replacement for the printing "
"subsystem itself. &kdeprint; does <emphasis>not</emphasis> therefore give "
"provision for spooling, and it does <emphasis>not</emphasis> do the basic "
"processing of &PostScript; or other print data."
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint; <emphasis>nije</emphasis> zamjena za štampački podsistem. "
"&kdeprint; <emphasis>ne</emphasis> daje odredbe za slanje podataka na "
"određeno mjesto i <emphasis>ne</emphasis> radi osnovne obrade &PostScript;-"
"aili nekih drugih štampačkih podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "What it <emphasis>is</emphasis>"
msgstr "Šta je <emphasis>da</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is an intermediate layer between the spooling and the data "
"processing print subsystem (as installed), and the application that seeks to "
"print. &kdeprint; provides a common interface for &kde; developers and &kde; "
"users, to various supported print subsystems. At the same time, it is "
"customizable, and highly configurable."
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint; je srednji sloj između spoolinga i obrade podataka štampačkih "
"podsistema (kako su instalirani), i aplikacije koja nastoji isprintati. "
"&kdeprint; omogućava poznati interface za &kde; developere i &kde; "
"korisnike, za različite podržane štampačke podsisteme. U isto vrijeme, on je "
"prilagodljiv, i jako podesiv."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is easy to use for both &kde; developers and end-users. "
"Developers can port their applications, with minimal changes, to use "
"&kdeprint; instead of the old &Qt; print <quote>system</quote>. Users can "
"easily choose and configure their print subsystem."
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint; lahko koriste i &kde; developeri i krajnji korisnici. Developeri "
"mogu umetnuti svoje aplikacije, sa minimalnim promjenama, da bi koristili "
"&kdeprint; umjesto starog &Qt; štampačkog <quote>sistema</quote>. Korisnici "
"mogu lahko izabrati i konfigurisati njihov štampački podsistem."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a reference to new &kde; users: &Qt; is the basic library and graphical "
"toolkit, which is used by all &kde; applications; &Qt; is developed by "
"TrollTech, a Norwegian software company."
msgstr ""
"Referenca novim &kde; korisnicima: &Qt; je osnovna biblioteka i grafički "
"alat, koji se koristi za sve &kde; aplikacije; &Qt; je razvio TrollTech, "
"norveška softverska kompanija."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; -- Different Usage for Different People"
msgstr "&kdeprint; -- Različita Upotreba za Različite Ljude"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; has different faces for different people."
msgstr "&kdeprint; ima raličita lica za različite ljude."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "What users and administrators can do with &kdeprint;"
msgstr "Šta korisnici i administratori mogu uraditi sa &kdeprint;"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; allows users and/or administrators, depending on their rights, "
"access to printing subsystems (&CUPS;, <acronym>LPD</acronym>, "
"<acronym>RLPR</acronym>, <application>LPRng</application>, <application>PDQ</"
"application> &etc;) through a &kde; graphical user interface (&GUI;). Using "
"&kdeprint;, they can print, administer jobs, printers and the printing "
"daemon, all in a comfortable manner."
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint; dozvoljava korisnicima i/ili administratorima, u zavisnosti od "
"njihovih prava, pristup štampačkim podsistemima (&CUPS;, <acronym>LPD</"
"acronym>, <acronym>RLPR</acronym>, <application>LPRng</application>, "
"<application>PDQ</application> &etc;) kroz &kde; grafički korisnički "
"interface (&GUI;). Koristeći &kdeprint;, mogu štampati, upravljati poslovima "
"i štampačima na ugodan način."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Experienced users will like the capability to plug any working filter for "
"the print data between the output of their application and the input, into "
"the chosen print subsystem. Some examples for this already ship with "
"<quote>plain vanilla</quote> &kdeprint;. Read on."
msgstr ""
"Iskusni korisnici će voljeti sposobnost da uključe bilo koji filter za "
"podatke o štampanju između izlaznih aplikacija i ulaznih, u odabrani "
"štampački podsistem. Neki primjeri za ovo se već isporučuju sa "
"<quote>standardnim</quote> &kdeprint;-om. Nastavite čitati."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "What &kde; developers can do with it..."
msgstr "Šta &kde; developeri mogu raditi s tim..."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a &kde; developer needs printing access for his application, he does not "
"code the printing functions from scratch. Before &kde; 2.2 this service was "
"provided by the <classname>QPrinter</classname> class, a library function of "
"the &Qt; Toolkit. The <classname>QPrinter</classname> class relied on the "
"out-moded <quote>Line Printer Daemon</quote> (<acronym>LPD</acronym>). The "
"&kdeprint; library bases itself firmly on the more modern Common &UNIX; "
"Printing System (&CUPS;), while at the same time keeping backward "
"compatibility with <acronym>LPD</acronym> and other legacy, or less "
"elaborate, print systems. It also <quote>leaves the door open</quote> for "
"any new development that might occur."
msgstr ""
"Ako &kde; developer treba dozvolu za štampanje za svoju primjenu, on neće "
"kodirati štampačke funkcije od samog početka. Prije &kde; 2.2 ovu uslugu je "
"pružala  klasa <classname>QPrinter</classname>-a, bibliotečka funkcija &Qt; "
"alata. <classname>QPrinter</classname> klasa se oslonila na staromodni "
"<quote>Line Printer Daemon</quote> (<acronym>LPD</acronym>). &kdeprint; "
"biblioteka se zasniva prvenstveno na modernijeg i poznatijeg &UNIX; "
"Štampačkog sistema (&CUPS;), dok u isto vrijeme čuva pasivnu kompatibilnost "
"sa <acronym>LPD</acronym> i ostale naslijeđene, ili manje detaljne štampačke "
"sisteme. Također <quote>ostavlja otvorena vrata</quote> za nove razvoje koji "
"mogu doći."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For &kde; developers to use the new &kdeprint; class in their applications, "
"they require only minimal changes to their code: for every call of "
"<classname>QPrinter</classname>, they just need to change this to "
"<classname>KPrinter</classname>. Replacing one (!) letter in a few spots, "
"and automatically they are done; their application can then use all of the "
"features of the new &kdeprint; library."
msgstr ""
"Za &kde; developere koji koriste novu &kdeprint; klasu u njihovim "
"aplikacijama, oni zahtjevaju samo minimalne promjene u njihovom kodu: svaki "
"poziv <classname>QPrinter</classname>-a, oni samo trebaju promijeniti u "
"<classname>KPrinter</classname>. Zamjena jednog (!) slova na nekoliko "
"mjesta, i automatski su gotovi; njihov program će onda moći koristiti sve "
"karakteristike nove &kdeprint; biblioteke."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More ambitious developers, or ones with special requirements, can do more: "
"despite &kdeprint;'s feature-rich framework, they are still able to "
"customize the print dialog of their application by creating an additional "
"<quote>Tab</quote>, where their extensions to the standard &kdeprint; will "
"feel right at home."
msgstr ""
"Ambiciozniji developeri, ili oni sa posebnim potrebama, mogu uraditi više: "
"uprkos &kdeprint;-ovim frameworkom sa mnogo karakteristika, oni su i dalje u "
"mogućnosi da prilagode štampački dijalog njihovih aplikacija kreirajući "
"<quote>Tab</quote>, gdje će se proširenja na standardni &kdeprint; osjećati "
"kaokod kuće."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This last mentioned feature has not been used widely inside &kde; so far, as "
"developers are not yet fully aware of &kdeprint;'s power. Expect more of "
"this in the near future. One example I discovered is the &kcron; "
"application. It lets you edit the crontab through a &GUI;. The developers "
"have implemented a printing feature that lets you (or <systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem>) choose if you want to print the whole of "
"crontab (for all users) or just the part that is marked. You can see the "
"effects on &kdeprint; in the following screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Posljednja spomenuta karakteristika nije bila u širokoj upotrebi unutar "
"&kde; do sada, jer developeri još nisu potpuno svjesni moći &kdeprint;-a. "
"Očekujte više u budućnosti. Jedan primjer koji sam otkrio je &kcron; "
"aplikacija. Ona omogućava da uredite crontab preko &GUI;. Developeri su "
"implementirali štampačku karakteristiku koja vam (ili <systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem>) omogućava da izaberete da li želite printati "
"cijeli crontab (za sve korisnike) ili samo označeni dio. Na sljedećim "
"slikama možete vidjeti efekte &kdeprint;a."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "This shot shows a sample from the &kcron; utility."
msgstr "Ova slika pokazuje uzorak &kcron; usluge."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcron; utility: a small sample of a system's cronjobs as shown through the "
"&kde; <acronym>GUI</acronym>&GUI;."
msgstr ""
"&kcron; usluga: mali uzorak sistemskih cronjob-ova prikazanih kroz &kde; "
"<acronym>GUI</acronym>&GUI;."

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kcron; developers let you choose to print the whole of the cron table "
"or just the marked part of it."
msgstr ""
"&kcron; developeri vam omogućavaju da odaberete štampanje cijele cron tabele "
"ili samo markiranog dijela."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog to configure &kcron;'s printing options: the additional tab "
"titled <guilabel>Cron Options</guilabel> is from inside &kcron;, not "
"&kdeprint;; it is a special extension added by the &kcron; developers for "
"printing purposes, not originating from, but executed by &kdeprint;. "
"Developers of other applications are free to implement their own goodies, if "
"they feel need for it."
msgstr ""
"Dijalog za konfigurisanje &kcron;-ovih štampačkih opcija: dodatni tab nazvan "
"<guilabel>Podešavanje Crona</guilabel> se nalazi u &kcron;a, a ne &kdeprint;-"
"a; to je specijalna ekstenzija koju su dodali &kcron; developeri za potrebe "
"štampanja, koje izvršava &kdeprint;. Developeri drugih aplikacija slobodno "
"mogu implementirati svoje karakteristike, ako imaju potrebe za tim."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kcron;-ov dodatak &kdeprint; dijalogu.</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kcron;-ov dodatak &kdeprint; dijalogu.</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</para>"
msgstr "<para>&kcron;-ov dodatak &kdeprint; dijalogu.</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "What &kdeprint; offers to everybody..."
msgstr "Šta&kdeprint; nudi svima..."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint;'s easy-to-use interface for all supported print subsystems of "
"course does not eliminate basic traditional weaknesses of some of those "
"systems. But it smooths some rough edges. Different users may use different "
"printing systems on the same box. A user is free to even switch <quote>on "
"the fly</quote>, from the print dialog, the print subsystem to be used for "
"the next job. (This is possible if different systems are installed in a way "
"that they don't <quote>get in each other's way</quote>.)"
msgstr ""
"&kdeprint;-ov interface kojeg je lahko koristiti zasve podržane štampačke "
"podsisteme naravno ne eliminiše osnovne tradicionalne nedostatke nekih od "
"tih sistema. Ali ublažava neke dijelove. Različiti korisnici mogu koristiti "
"različite štampačke sisteme na istom mjestu. Korisniku je omogućeno čak i da "
"prebacuje <quote>usput</quote>, iz dijaloškog okvira, da štampački podsistem "
"bude korišten za sljedeći posao. (Ovo je moguće ako su različiti sistemi "
"instalirani na način na koji oni ne smetaju jedno drugom.)"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most &UNIX; users are used to <acronym>LPD</acronym> printing. <acronym>LPD</"
"acronym> provides only basic printing functions, is very inflexible and does "
"not utilize the many options of more modern print systems like &CUPS;. While "
"also working remotely over any distance (like every TCP/IP based protocol), "
"<acronym>LPD</acronym> lacks bi-directional communication, authentication, "
"access control and encryption support."
msgstr ""
"Većina &UNIX; korisnika su navikli na <acronym>LPD</acronym> štampanje.  "
"<acronym>LPD</acronym> omogućava samo osnovne štampačke funkcije, nije "
"fleksibilan i nema mnogo opcija modernih štampačkih sistema kao &CUPS;. Dok "
"također rade na daljinu sa bilo koje udaljenosti (kao svaki TCP/IP protokol) "
"<acronym>LPD</acronym>-u fali dvosmjerna komunikacija, autentikacija, "
"kontrola pristupa i podrška enkripcije."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; can use &CUPS; to support:"
msgstr "&kdeprint; može koristiti &CUPS; za podršku:"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Querying the <acronym>LAN</acronym> for available printers,"
msgstr "Upiti <acronym>LAN</acronym> za dostupne štampače,"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic, Digest, and Certificate Authentication,"
msgstr "Osnovna, Digest i Certificirana Autentikacija,"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Access Control based on <acronym>IP</acronym> addresses, net addresses, "
"netmasks, host- and domain names,"
msgstr ""
"Kontrola Pristupa zasnovana na <acronym>IP</acronym> adresama, mrežnim "
"adresama, netmaskama, hostovima i domenama,"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"and 128-Bit TLS or SSL3 encryption of print data, to prevent eavesdropping, "
"or at least make it much more difficult."
msgstr ""
"i 128-Bit TLS ili SSL3 enkripcija štampačkih podataka, da bi se spriječilo "
"prisluškivanje, ili barem otežalo."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This makes &kdeprint; a much more robust and reliable solution than using "
"the venerable <acronym>LPD</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo čini &kdeprint; mnogo snažnijim i pouzdanijim rješenjem od drevnog "
"<acronym>LPD</acronym>."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to access &kdeprint;"
msgstr "Kako pristupiti &kdeprint;-u"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "You get access to &kdeprint;, or parts of it, in four different ways:"
msgstr ""
"Pristup &kdeprint;-u, ili dijelovima njega imate na četiri različita načina:"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"through your applications: if you call the printing dialog (either "
"<menuchoice><guilabel>File</guilabel> <guilabel>Print...</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>) or the button with the little printer icon on it; this opens "
"the printing dialog."
msgstr ""
"kroz aplikacije: ako pozovete štampački dijalog (ili "
"<menuchoice><guilabel>File</guilabel> <guilabel>Print...</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>) ili dugme sa malom slikom štampača na njemu; ono otvrata "
"štampački dijalog."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"through the typed command <command>kprinter</command> in a "
"<application>terminal</application> or a &konsole; window or from the "
"<guilabel>Run Command...</guilabel> mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym> window: this "
"also opens the printing dialog."
msgstr ""
"preko ukucane komande <command>kprinter</command> u <application>terminalu</"
"application> ili &konsole; prozoru ili preko <guilabel>Pokreni Komandu...</"
"guilabel> mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym> prozoru: ovo također otvara štampački "
"dijalog."

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"from the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"kcontrol-icon."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> button, starting "
"&kcontrol;, and then go to <menuchoice><guilabel>System</"
"guilabel><guilabel>Printing Manager</guilabel></menuchoice>. This opens the "
"&kdeprint; administration which is part of the &kcontrolcenter; and also "
"lets you switch to other parts of the &kcontrol;"
msgstr ""
"preko <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"kcontrol-icon.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> dugmeta, pokrenuti "
"&kcontrol;, a onda ići na <menuchoice><guilabel>Sistem</"
"guilabel><guilabel>Štampački dijalog</guilabel></menuchoice>. Ovo otvara "
"&kdeprint; administraciju koja je dio &kcontrolcenter;-a i također "
"dozvoljava vam da prebacite na druge dijelove &kcontrol;"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"from a command line (&konsole; or mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym>) type "
"<userinput> <command>kcmshell</command> <option>printmgr</option></"
"userinput>. This opens just the &kdeprint; part of &kcontrol; to change your "
"settings"
msgstr ""
"sa komandne linije  (&konsole; ili mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym>) ukucajte "
"<userinput> <command>kcmshell</command> <option>printmgr</option></"
"userinput>.  Ovo otvara samo &kdeprint; dio &kcontrol;-e kako bi promijenilo "
"vaša podešavanja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kprinter; dialog to be started from <guilabel>Run Command...</guilabel> "
"window"
msgstr ""
"&kprinter; dijalog se može pokrenuti sa <guilabel>Pokreni Komandu...</"
"guilabel> prozorom"

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>Starting the &kprinter; dialog from a <guilabel>Run Command...</"
"guilabel> window.</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>Pokretanje &kprinter; dijaloga sa <guilabel>Pokreni Komandu...</"
"guilabel> prozorom.</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
